  /// **Authoring guidance.** Add one entry per client application of the system. A client that is not listed here does not exist, however thoroughly the requirement subsections below describe the machines it would run on.
  SomList<ClientApplicationEntry> get clientApplications => SomList<ClientApplicationEntry>(doc, '$path/CLIAPP-CLIE-LST', (d, p) => ClientApplicationEntry(d, p), pattern: 'CLIAPP-CLIE-xxx');

